<div class="card p-4" style="border-left: 3px solid var(--fitlog-green);">
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3">
        <h6 class="fw-bold mb-0">Macro guide</h6>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" onclick="document.getElementById('tdeeExplainerPanel').classList.toggle('d-none')">What is TDEE?</button>
    </div>
    <div id="tdeeExplainerPanel" class="card p-3 mb-3 d-none">
        <p class="text-muted small mb-1"><strong>TDEE</strong> — Total calories burned per day including activity.</p>
        <p class="text-muted small mb-0"><strong>TDEE = BMR x Activity Multiplier</strong> (1.2 to 1.725)</p>
